{
 "encounter_id": "00828",
 "speakers": {
  "person_1": "PATIENT",
  "person_2": "DOCTOR",
  "person_3": "CLINICAL_STAFF"
 },
 "turns": [
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Okay, so I kept a log. My right knee swelled up five days ago after a long day kneeling on a tile floor, and it hasn't gone down. I have the dates on my phone."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Good, thanks. Show me when you're ready. Is it only swollen, or is it painful too?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Painful, yes, it hurts in the knee. But I can't tell you when exactly the pain started. I wrote the swelling date, not the pain. I think the pain came first, maybe two days before. Maybe not."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "That's fine. Does it feel stiff?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Stiff after sitting in the truck, yes. Takes a minute to straighten."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Is it warm?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Warm to the touch, compared to the left. I checked with the back of my hand."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "And where does it hurt most?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Right at the front, over the kneecap. Tender when I press."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any fever?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fever, I took it last night."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Redness?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No redness."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Does the knee lock?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No locking."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Did you fall or twist it?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No fall, no twist."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Chills or sweats?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No chills."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What medications are you taking?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Ibuprofen, maybe 400 mg, three times a day, for the knee. Metformin, 500 mg, twice a day, breakfast and dinner, though I skip some dinners. Lisinopril, 10 mg, once a day. And omeprazole, 20 mg, once a day."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Okay. Any allergies?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Penicillin. My lips swelled up."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Medical history?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Type 2 diabetes and high blood pressure."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Surgery?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Left knee scope in 2015. And a right shoulder surgery in 2019."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Family?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "My father has gout. My mother has arthritis."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "What do you do for work?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Flooring installer, mostly tile. So a lot of kneeling."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Alcohol?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two beers after work, most days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "Doc, the blood draw tray is ready whenever you want it. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Thanks, give me five minutes. Let me check you. Temperature 37.9, blood pressure 132 over 84, pulse 84.",
   "pause": 12.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Is the temperature high? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Slightly. Let me see the knee.",
   "pause": 10.0
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Careful. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "There's swelling over the front of the right knee, like a bag of fluid in front of the kneecap."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's what I've been looking at. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's warm, and tender over the kneecap itself. The knee still bends fully, though."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "It bends, yes. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Any trouble with your breathing, chest?"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "No, nothing at all, my chest is fine."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "This could be bursitis from kneeling, but I can't rule out an infection in the bursa, given the warmth and the temperature."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Infection? From kneeling? ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It happens when the skin gets broken. I'd like to arrange blood tests, including inflammation markers, and an X-ray of the knee."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_3",
   "t": "I can draw the bloods now, if you like. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "Please. And I'd like to do an ultrasound of the knee, and I may need to draw some fluid out with a needle."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Sounds unpleasant. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "It's quick. Stop the ibuprofen on an empty stomach, and rest the knee, no kneeling for now."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "That's a week's pay gone. ~"
  },
  {
   "s": "person_2",
   "t": "I'd like to see you again in two days."
  },
  {
   "s": "person_1",
   "t": "Two days. I'll be here. ~"
  }
 ],
